 "stimulus_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\">\n  <li>Here is one way an expression in standard form is rewritten into vertex form.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Original expression<br> <span data-math=\"x^2−7x+6\">x^2−7x+6</span></p>\n<p><strong>Step 1</strong> - <span data-math=\"x^2−7x+(-\\frac{7}{2})^2+6−(-\\frac{7}{2})^2\">x^2−7x+(-\\frac{7}{2})^2+6−(-\\frac{7}{2})^2</span></p>\n<p><strong>Step 2</strong> - <span data-math=\"(x−\\frac{7}{2})^2+6−\\frac{49}{4}\">(x−\\frac{7}{2})^2+6−\\frac{49}{4}</span></p>\n<p><strong>Step 3</strong> - <span data-math=\"(x−\\frac{7}{2})^2+\\frac{24}{4}−\\frac{49}{4}\">(x−\\frac{7}{2})^2+\\frac{24}{4}−\\frac{49}{4}</span></p>\n<p><strong>Step 4</strong> - <span data-math=\"(x−\\frac{7}{2})^2-\\frac{25}{4}\">(x−\\frac{7}{2})^2-\\frac{25}{4}</span></p>",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 646832,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>In Step 1, where did the number <span data-math=\"-\\frac{7}{2}\">-\\frac{7}{2}</span> come from?</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1273441,
     "content_html": "Only the non-linear term was divided by 2."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273442,
     "content_html": "It is half of -7 being squared."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273443,
     "content_html": "Every term in the expression was divided by 2."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273444,
     "content_html": "It is the substitute value for <span data-math=\"x\">x</span>."
    }
   ],
