     "content_html": "The linear term is written as a fraction so that it has a common denominator, which makes it easier to subtract."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273455,
     "content_html": "A random term was added to complete the square."
    },
    {
     "id": 1273456,
     "content_html": "The quadratic term is written as a fraction so that it has a common denominator, which makes it easier to subtract."
    }
